{"title": "Faerûn", "pageid": 1818, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Faerûn", "categories": ["Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Faerun_map.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Faerun_map.webp/300px-Faerun_map.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Faerun_map.webp/450px-Faerun_map.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Faerun_map.webp/600px-Faerun_map.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Faerun_map.webp/300px-Faerun_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"216\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Faerun_map.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>A map of Faerûn, by Karen Wynn Fonstad</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Faerûn</b> is a major continent on <a href=\"/wiki/Toril\" title=\"Toril\">Toril</a>, and is the place where the vast majority of the events of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a> happen.\n</p><p>The word Faerûn is a modified version of the name of the homeland of the ancient <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">elves</a>, \"Faerie\".\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Regions\">Notable Regions</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_Coast\" title=\"Sword Coast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sword Coast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sword_Coast\" title=\"Sword Coast\">Sword Coast</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elturel\" title=\"Elturel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elturel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Elturel\" title=\"Elturel\">Elturel</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-